  "steps": [
    "Make small slits in the boiled eggs and fry them in 1 tbsp coconut oil for 2 minutes until lightly golden; set aside.",
    "In the same pan heat the remaining oil and crackle the mustard seeds, then add curry leaves.",
    "Add the onion and a pinch of salt and cook for 10 minutes until deep golden brown.",
    "Add the ginger garlic paste and green chilli and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the tomato and cook until pulpy, then add turmeric, chilli powder, coriander powder, fennel seeds and the remaining salt.",
    "Add the water and simmer for 5 minutes until the masala is thick and oily.",
    "Return the eggs, coat gently, sprinkle black pepper and cook for 2 minutes."
  ]
